# Auto-Translate
writeassist_enable_auto_translate = Auto-translate articles/categories (on creation)
writeassist_enable_auto_translate_notice = When enabled, titles of newly created articles and categories are automatically translated into all other languages using the translation service selected above (DeepL or Text-AI). Requires the selected service to be configured.
writeassist_translate_on_rename = Auto-translate articles/categories (on rename)
writeassist_translate_on_rename_notice = When enabled, the name of an article or category is automatically translated into all other languages using the translation service selected above (DeepL or Text-AI) whenever it is saved. Existing translations will be overwritten.

